  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q31.c ****  * @brief  Negates the elements of a Q31 vector.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q31.c ****  * @param[in]  *pSrc points to the input vector
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q31.c ****  * @param[out]  *pDst points to the output vector
