  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q31.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q31.c ****  * \par
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q31.c ****  * The function uses saturating arithmetic.
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q31.c ****  * The Q31 value -1 (0x80000000) will be saturated to the maximum allowable positive value 0x7FFFFF
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q31.c ****  */
